fields.Needs confirmation:
Classroom numbers and other facilities;
    exact meaning of the motorcycle entry time, any exceptions, and
    official source/date.

fields.New students:
Accomplished enrollment form; birth certificate;
    report card or transcript of records; good moral character
    certificate; valid ID.

fields.Returning students:
Student ID; previous academic records;
    accomplished enrollment form; required clearance or other documents
    requested by the college.

fields.Process:
Inquire about programs; obtain and complete form;
    submit documents; take an entrance exam or interview if required;
    await evaluation/result; follow enrollment instructions if accepted.

fields.Emergency contact:
911 in the Philippines where available;
    obtain current local fire, police, MDRRMO, and school administration
    contacts.
